{"id":"de_ception","lemma":"déception","pos":"noun","rank":4547,"glosses":["disappointment"],"ipa":"/de.sɛp.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1e/Fr-d%C3%A9ception.ogg/Fr-d%C3%A9ception.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"déceptions"},"formAudio":{"déceptions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-d%C3%A9ceptions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'était un peu une déception.","en":"It was kind of a bummer.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a little, a bit"]]},{"text":"J'ai eu trop de déceptions.","en":"I've had too many disappointments.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"excessive,"]]},{"text":"Ce fut une déception.","en":"That was a disappointment.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"J'ai essayé de cacher ma déception.","en":"I tried to hide my disappointment.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to test, to try on","l":"essayer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to hide"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null]},{"text":"À ma grande déception, elle n'est pas venue.","en":"Much to my disappointment, she did not come.","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"coming, arrival"}]}]}